# libjpeg-turbo -- JPEG decoding for gdk-pixbuf, which is what draws every
# wallpaper and every photo thumbnail.
#
# WITH_SIMD=OFF is a portability decision with a real cost. The x86 SIMD paths
# are written in assembly and require nasm to build, and nasm is not packaged;
# on aarch64 the SIMD is intrinsics and would build, but a flag that means one
# thing on one architecture and another elsewhere is worse than a flag that
# means one thing. Packaging nasm and turning this on is a worthwhile follow-up
# -- it is roughly a factor of two on JPEG decode.
#
# Not an LFS package, so it is pinned here rather than in versions.env.
SRC_URL=https://github.com/libjpeg-turbo/libjpeg-turbo/releases/download/3.1.0/libjpeg-turbo-3.1.0.tar.gz
SRC_SHA256=9564c72b1dfd1d6fe6274c5f95a8d989b59854575d4bbee44ade7bc17aa9bc93
SRC_DIR=libjpeg-turbo-3.1.0

CMAKE_ARGS="-DENABLE_STATIC=OFF -DWITH_SIMD=OFF -DWITH_JPEG8=ON -DCMAKE_INSTALL_DEFAULT_LIBDIR=lib"
